cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PyClimExtract: time-anchored climate exposure windows for georeferenced survey data"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that links gridded climate and environmental data to
  georeferenced records by building an exposure window around each
  record's own observation date, extracting the matching grid cells, and
  reducing them to per-record exposures.
type: software
